pve-meta (0.3.1-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Managed files: reservation and deletion agree on operator identity
    (same-operator renames converge, cross-writer claims refuse by name),
    and each plane collects only its own manifest records. v0.3.0 lacked
    the deletion half; no consumer existed yet, nothing broke.

