pve-meta (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Guest files grow a managed plane for operators: manifest records carry
    a `source` (`user/<entry>` or `managed/<operator>/<name>`, pre-source files
    read back as their own entry), entries can be built content-direct
    (`Entry::managed`, `Desired::direct`, `GuestFiles::managed`) and flow
    through the same plan, commit, manifest and lock, a path recorded for
    another source is refused naming both, and tag lists share
    `node::split_tags`. No behaviour change for document readers; the daemon
    never sees managed files. (`docs/GUEST-FILES.md`: Managed files.)

